```css
body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; color: #222; }
.app { max-width: 480px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 1.5rem; background: #fff;
  border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
h1 { margin-top: 0; text-align: center; }
button { cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #ccc; background: #fff; border-radius: 4px; padding: .4rem .8rem; }
button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
.add-form { display: flex; gap: .5rem; }
.add-form input { flex: 1; padding: .5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
.filters { display: flex; gap: .5rem; justify-content: center; margin: 1rem 0; }
.filters button { text-transform: capitalize; }
.filters .active { background: #2563eb; border-color: #2563eb; color: #fff; }
.todo-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.todo-list li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; padding: .6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
.todo-list li span, .todo-list .edit { flex: 1; font-size: 1rem; }
.todo-list li.done span { text-decoration: line-through; color: #999; }
.delete { border: none; color: #c00; font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 0 .4rem; }
footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .9rem; }
.hint { text-align: center; font-size: .8rem; color: #888; margin-bottom: 0; }
```

**Features:**
- Add, complete, edit (double-click) and delete todos.
- Filter by all, active or completed.
- An items-left counter and a "Clear completed" button.
- Todos persist in `localStorage`.

